<div class="page-header"><h1>Kitchen Cabinets in Los Angeles, CA</h1><p>Planning a kitchen remodel or new build in LA? Pinnacle Sales represents five premium cabinetry brands — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — sold through independent Los Angeles-area showrooms with designers who spec these lines every day.</p></div>
