<h2 id="los-angeles-kitchen-design-trends">Los Angeles Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>LA kitchens range from light, transitional coastal looks in the beach communities to sleek modern in the hills and canyons. Two-tone schemes, white-oak and walnut islands, and warm-minimalist palettes are common, while the high-end Westside, Pasadena foothills, and hillside enclaves increasingly favor handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> and seamless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> kitchens.</p>
